---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  pageId="privacy"
  title="Privacy | Alabama Veteran"
  description="How Alabama Veteran collects, stores, and shares personal information on this website."
>
  <div id="page-privacy" class="page active">
    <section class="ab-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow ctr">Alabama Veteran</div>
        <h1>How we handle <span class="red">personal information</span></h1>
        <p>
          This page describes the data this website collects. It is not a HIPAA certification and is
          not legal advice.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="ab-mission">
      <div class="container" style="max-width: 720px">
        <h2 class="st bl">Warrior Retreat applications</h2>
        <p>
          The production application at <code>/warrior-retreat-application/</code> stores name, contact
          details, address, service history, employment answers, emergency contact, retreat goals, and
          consent in Alabama Veteran’s AWS account (encrypted DynamoDB). Invited staff review applications
          after signing in with Cognito. The public GitHub Pages site is the current test origin and uses
          this same production application service until DNS cutover.
        </p>
        <p>
          This website does not collect diagnoses, medications, crisis details, or other health
          information on the application. Do not enter Social Security numbers or payment card
          numbers in any field. Health and accessibility planning happens through a private
          follow-up after staff review.
        </p>
        <h2 class="st bl">Newsletter, volunteer, and 9 Line forms</h2>
        <p>
          Newsletter signup, volunteer interest, and the AV 9 Line form are hosted by GoHighLevel
          (white-label <code>app.alabamaveteran.org</code>). Those submissions leave this website
          and are not stored in the AWS application tables. Do not use those forms for emergencies.
          Call or text <a href="tel:988">988</a> and press 1 for the Veterans Crisis Line.
        </p>
        <h2 class="st bl">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          The site contact control opens your email app to <a href="mailto:info@alabamaveteran.org"
            >info@alabamaveteran.org</a
          >. Alabama Veteran does not store that message on this website.
        </p>
        <h2 class="st bl">Fonts and analytics</h2>
        <p>
          Brand fonts are served from this website. The public site does not load Google Fonts.
          Calendar listings may be read from a public JSON feed on GitHub; that feed does not
          include application records.
        </p>
        <h2 class="st bl">Requests</h2>
        <p>
          To ask a question about an application or request a correction, email
          <a href="mailto:info@alabamaveteran.org">info@alabamaveteran.org</a> with your reference number
          if you have one.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
